  "transcript_source": "captions",
  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 0.84,
      "e": 2.72,
      "text": "- Military search and rescue!"
    },
    {
      "s": 2.72,
      "e": 4.77,
      "text": "Round 10 for clearance if you can hear me!"
    },
    {
      "s": 4.77,
      "e": 7.53,
      "text": "- [Michael] Guardian Response 2017"
    },
    {
      "s": 7.53,
      "e": 9.6,
      "text": "is a total force exercise designed to test and teach"
    },
    {
      "s": 9.6,
      "e": 12.1,
      "text": "the Army's response to a devastating event"
    },
    {
      "s": 12.1,
      "e": 13.93,
      "text": "like a nuclear attack."
    },
    {
      "s": 13.93,
      "e": 16.49,
      "text": "Soldiers with the 355th Engineer Detachment"
    },
    {
      "s": 16.49,
      "e": 18.18,
      "text": "from Danvers, Massachusetts"
    },
    {
      "s": 18.18,
      "e": 20.33,
      "text": "trained on urban search and rescue to facilitate"
    },
    {
      "s": 20.33,
      "e": 23.1,
      "text": "rescue and decontamination of victims."
    },
    {
      "s": 23.1,
      "e": 25.04,
      "text": "- Urban search and rescue is,"
    },
    {
      "s": 25.04,
      "e": 26.89,
      "text": "we call it technical rescue,"
    },
    {
      "s": 26.89,
      "e": 29.45,
      "text": "is highly specialized in that there are five"
    },
    {
      "s": 29.45,
      "e": 31.7,
      "text": "disciplines involved in it."
    },
    {
      "s": 32.26,
      "e": 33.26,
      "text": "Rope rescue,"
    },
    {
      "s": 33.54,
      "e": 34.71,
      "text": "trench rescue,"
    },
    {
      "s": 34.85,
      "e": 36.47,
      "text": "confined space rescue,"
    },
    {
      "s": 36.47,
      "e": 38.14,
      "text": "structural collapse,"
    },
    {
      "s": 40.45,
      "e": 43.62,
      "text": "and it takes a high degree of training"
    },
    {
      "s": 43.73,
      "e": 47.57,
      "text": "to be able to conduct those Technical Rescues."
    },
    {
      "s": 50.56,
      "e": 51.77,
      "text": "- There's always something to be learned,"
    },
    {
      "s": 51.77,
      "e": 52.65,
      "text": "whether you're,"
    },
    {
      "s": 52.65,
      "e": 53.48,
      "text": "you know,"
    },
    {
      "s": 53.78,
      "e": 54.8,
      "text": "been here for seven years or whether you've only been here"
    },
    {
      "s": 54.8,
      "e": 55.81,
      "text": "for one week."
    },
    {
      "s": 55.81,
      "e": 57.71,
      "text": "Each time we come out to do theses type of training events"
    },
    {
      "s": 57.71,
      "e": 59.44,
      "text": "you're always learning something new,"
    },
    {
      "s": 59.44,
      "e": 60.39,
      "text": "you're either with,"
    },
    {
      "s": 60.39,
      "e": 61.22,
      "text": "you know,"
    },
    {
      "s": 61.38,
      "e": 62.53,
      "text": "different people on your team,"
    },
    {
      "s": 62.53,
      "e": 63.73,
      "text": "performing different tasks,"
    },
    {
      "s": 63.73,
      "e": 65.4,
      "text": "we never walk into the same situation"
    },
    {
      "s": 65.4,
      "e": 68.29,
      "text": "so each time we come out we're facing something new,"
    },
    {
      "s": 68.29,
      "e": 71.56,
      "text": "we may be experience scenarios that are similar,"
    },
    {
      "s": 71.56,
      "e": 72.56,
      "text": "but each time it's new."
    },
    {
      "s": 72.56,
      "e": 75.22,
      "text": "So every time we go out there and practice one of our"
    },
    {
      "s": 75.22,
      "e": 76.42,
      "text": "tech rescue skills,"
    },
    {
      "s": 76.42,
      "e": 77.73,
      "text": "or saving somebody,"
    },
    {
      "s": 77.73,
      "e": 78.56,
      "text": "you know,"
    },
    {
      "s": 78.86,
      "e": 80.98,
      "text": "we try to rotate people in to get them experience with"
    },
    {
      "s": 80.98,
      "e": 81.81,
      "text": "you know,"
    },
    {
      "s": 82.17,
      "e": 83.27,
      "text": "being a hands-on rescuer."
    },
    {
      "s": 83.27,
      "e": 84.3,
      "text": "We try to rotate leadership positions."
    },
    {
      "s": 84.3,
      "e": 86.22,
      "text": "That way everyone can understand the bigger position"
    },
    {
      "s": 86.22,
      "e": 87.36,
      "text": "behind what we're doing."
    },
    {
      "s": 87.36,
      "e": 88.79,
      "text": "- [Michael] They participated in events designed to teach"
    },
    {
      "s": 88.79,
      "e": 90.27,
      "text": "search and rescue operations"
    },
    {
      "s": 90.27,
      "e": 92.16,
      "text": "on one of the most realistic training environments"
    },
    {
      "s": 92.16,
      "e": 93.24,
      "text": "in the world."
    },
    {
      "s": 93.69,
      "e": 96.67,
      "text": "- [Man 1] I think the training is very realistic,"
    },
    {
      "s": 96.67,
      "e": 98.92,
      "text": "especially here in Muscatatuck"
    },
    {
      "s": 98.92,
      "e": 102.41,
      "text": "because they have the backdrop that is so hard"
    },
    {
      "s": 102.41,
      "e": 104.49,
      "text": "to provide anywhere else,"
    },
    {
      "s": 104.74,
      "e": 105.57,
      "text": "the smoke,"
    },
    {
      "s": 105.91,
      "e": 108.53,
      "text": "the buildings that are collapsed,"
    },
    {
      "s": 108.53,
      "e": 109.36,
      "text": "the fires."
    },
    {
      "s": 112.92,
      "e": 116.65,
      "text": "It's probably one of the best venues in North America"
    },
    {
      "s": 116.65,
      "e": 118.45,
      "text": "for this type of training,"
    },
    {
      "s": 118.45,
      "e": 121.36,
      "text": "and it's something the soldiers don't get to see that often."
    },
    {
      "s": 121.36,
      "e": 124.94,
      "text": "When we train them it's hard to approximate"
    },
    {
      "s": 125.26,
      "e": 127.7,
      "text": "what a real rescue scene is going to be like,"
    },
    {
      "s": 127.7,
      "e": 130.32,
      "text": "with displaced civilians walking around,"
    },
    {
      "s": 130.32,
      "e": 132.41,
      "text": "looking for help and food"
    },
    {
      "s": 133.05,
      "e": 134.7,
      "text": "and all of those things,"
    },
    {
      "s": 134.7,
      "e": 138.87,
      "text": "very, very hard and expensive to simulate anywhere else."
    },
    {
      "s": 142.41,
      "e": 143.68,
      "text": "- No matter what religion,"
    },
    {
      "s": 143.68,
      "e": 145.6,
      "text": "political view, you know,"
    },
    {
      "s": 145.6,
      "e": 146.77,
      "text": "you come from,"
    },
    {
      "s": 146.97,
      "e": 148.24,
      "text": "everyone has a strong understanding of"
    },
    {
      "s": 148.24,
      "e": 149.07,
      "text": "you know,"
    },
    {
      "s": 149.39,
      "e": 151.22,
      "text": "the need for our type of service."
    },
    {
      "s": 151.22,
      "e": 153.24,
      "text": "Picture one of your family members or somebody close to you"
    },
    {
      "s": 153.24,
      "e": 154.42,
      "text": "being in this type of situation"
    },
    {
      "s": 154.42,
      "e": 156.92,
      "text": "and everyone is always happy to know that"
    },
    {
      "s": 156.92,
      "e": 157.75,
      "text": "you know,"
    },
    {
      "s": 157.75,
      "e": 159.56,
      "text": "the type of training that we get"
    },
    {
      "s": 159.56,
      "e": 160.98,
      "text": "and the type of service that we provide"
    },
    {
      "s": 160.98,
      "e": 162.77,
      "text": "we come in and get people out safely."
    },
    {
      "s": 162.77,
      "e": 164.32,
      "text": "- [Michael] Nearly 4,100 soldiers from all"
    },
    {
      "s": 164.32,
      "e": 165.92,
      "text": "components of the Army participated in"
    },
    {
      "s": 165.92,
      "e": 167.49,
      "text": "Guardian Response 17,"
    },
    {
      "s": 167.49,
      "e": 169.66,
      "text": "validating the Army's ability to respond to a"
    },
    {
      "s": 169.66,
      "e": 172.75,
      "text": "chemical, biological, radiological or nuclear event."
    },
    {
      "s": 172.75,
      "e": 174.47,
      "text": "From Muscatatuck Urban Training Center"
    },
    {
      "s": 174.47,
      "e": 175.7,
      "text": "in Butlerville, Indiana,"
    },
    {
      "s": 175.7,
      "e": 177.42,
      "text": "I'm Sergeant Michael Ito."
    }
  ],
